            "review_text": "Sanz\nMadrid, Spain4 contributions\n0\nFantastic\nJan 2026 • Couples\nWe were looking to eat Spanish food after several days eating only local food. This restaurant is fantastic, probably better than many in Spain. Excellent Galician octopus, chorizo, croquettes, and an incredible cheesecake.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Spanish\nShow original\nWritten January 22, 2026",
